><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くを<ruby>物語<rp>(</rp><rt>ものがた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个故事讲述了很多发生在美国的事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものごと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">事物；万物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229953\">あるがままに<ruby>物事<rp>(</rp><rt>ものごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るようにしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试着看事情的原样</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物差し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものさし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尺子；量尺；测量棒；标准；准则；尺度；衡量标准</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物凄い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものすごい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">惊人的；巨大的；极端的；可怕的；恐怖的；令人毛骨悚然的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221066\">この<ruby>植物<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>根<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がものすごく<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">植物的根对水很贪婪</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物好き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものずき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">闲适的好奇心；异想天开；怪癖；古怪的爱好</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物足りない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ものたりない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不够的；不满足的；有所欠缺的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">モノレール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">单轨铁路；单轨电车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最早</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もはや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">已经；现在；不再；已不</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91347\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもはや<ruby>以前<rp>(</rp><rt>いぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她不再是以前的样子了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">模範</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もはん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词